7AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"al3Ri6TEqa2rBzjHsn0T_g","review_id":"byr1hgm67q2rG7GiACmvuw","date":"2018-11-30T15:09:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9465831518173218,"text_excerpt":"Convenience brought me here as I was staying close by but the great food and friendly service is what would bring me back. The coffee shop is bright, open, and modern with a lot of cool artwork on the wall that you can look at as you wait for your food. There's the main room with bar and high top table seating and they also have additional seating in what feels like a wide hallway/lobby. I ordered the fig'ama'jig sandwich because goat cheese, figs, and egg sounded like my jam. The server suggested I get it on the croissant instead of the ciabatta. I love ciabatta but I'm glad I listened to her and got it on the croissant. The croissant was really good and the sandwich was delicious and fi..."},{"business_id":"al3Ri6TEqa2rBzjHsn0T_g","review_id":"EfmHMS5NVDCQa4GC8P9UmQ","date":"2015-02-11T03:37:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435805082321167,"text_excerpt":"Aw man this place was such a nice break from the heavy and fried foods we'd been eating all week! I had the lox crostini and my friend had a pumpkin parfait. The lox crostini was great, but I was pretty jealous of the parfait! It looked amazing and my friend really enjoyed it! Definitely wouldn't mind going back to try other items on the menu. The coffee was okay. Not that big a fan of illy coffees, and I got a latte with soy and it was overall pretty bland. But the place is spacious and relaxing, service is nice. I thought it was a great place overall to go catch up with a friend, and have a bite to eat with a morning coffee."},{"business_id":"al3Ri6TEqa2rBzjHsn0T_g","review_id":"iqhRtfOl3GhsevkLC0NF0g","date":"2015-12-29T17:56:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.930955171585083,"text_excerpt":"Grabbed a quick bite here with my sister this morning. Had the \"Prosciutto\" crepe with prosciutto, tomato, fontina, balsamic, onion, basil, and truffle butter. It came with a salad and I had a cup of cappuccino as my beverage. The crepe was very nice as was the cappuccino. The side salad was bland and uninteresting and seem to be more of a placeholder or an afterthought. The Decour was bright and open and sparse but stylish with interesting local art. The staff was friendly and professional. I would definitely go back and try some more of their crepes as well as some of their coffees."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"al3Ri6TEqa2rBzjHsn0T_g","photo_id":"sCdpTX3t-1EJOoFXj_H9UA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sCdpTX3t-1EJOoFXj_H9UA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8746503591537476},{"business_id":"al3Ri6TEqa2rBzjHsn0T_g","photo_id":"8Fg7B7ZLF237vHRyRTZ1hQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8Fg7B7ZLF237vHR